---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy notice" description="Information about Mew & Maple website features and technical requests.">
  <section class="container prose-page">

    <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
    {/* Internal release requirement: This is not a final legal privacy policy. The responsible publisher, applicable jurisdictions, contact details, hosting configuration, lawful bases, retention periods and rights-request procedure must be confirmed before public release. */}

    <h2>Current website features</h2>
    <p>The current site source contains no configured Google Analytics, advertising pixel, mailing-list signup or active affiliate tracking. The article search uses a static JSON index; it does not send the entered query to a Mew & Maple application server. These observations describe the reviewed source, not every log or security system operated by the hosting providers.</p>

    <h2>Hosting and technical requests</h2>
    <p>The main website at mewandmaple.com is currently served by GitHub Pages. A separate deployment is available at mew-maple.samiayten-hu.workers.dev through Cloudflare Workers Static Assets. These are separate hosting endpoints; the main domain is not currently routed to the Worker. When someone visits a live website, the hosting and network providers may handle technical details such as IP address, browser or request information for delivery, security and troubleshooting. The actual controller/processor roles, log collection, recipients, storage regions and retention periods must be checked against the account's settings and applicable terms.</p>

    <h2>Cookies and third parties</h2>
    <p>Remote Google Fonts loading has been removed. The site currently includes no deliberately configured analytics or advertising tracking scripts. Hosting providers may also operate security controls and technical logs.</p>

    <h2>Your rights and contact</h2>
    <p>Applicable privacy rights and complaint routes depend on the real publisher, audience, legal bases and jurisdictions. A public publisher contact and a privacy-request contact are not currently listed on this website.</p>

    <h2>Future changes</h2>
    <p>Analytics, commerce, newsletter subscriptions, affiliate programs or personalized features are not currently enabled. If enabled later, this notice and any consent controls must be updated before the relevant processing begins.</p>

    {/* Internal release requirement: Publication blocker: do not remove this draft status until the accountable publisher and real technical processing inventory have been independently reviewed. */}
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
